  "goodToKnow": "Gesundheitlich means health-related or in terms of health: gesundheitliche Probleme, gesundheitlich angeschlagen (in poor health). Aus gesundheitlichen Gründen (for health reasons) is the standard phrase when a politician or athlete steps down. Don't confuse it with gesund (healthy): Obst ist gesund. Die Gesundheit is health, and Gesundheit! is what Germans say when someone sneezes; the polite reply is Danke!"
